    "Fields added here become optional Metadata fields for every Note in this role. A field key and value type are permanent. Labels, descriptions, and order can change; archiving is reversible and preserves every stored value." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此处添加的字段会成为该角色下每篇笔记的可选元数据字段。字段键和值类型不可更改。标签、说明和顺序可以修改；归档可撤销，并会保留所有已存储的值。"
          }
