            "value" : "Scholium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium Metadata" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 元数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium cannot establish its Application Support storage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium cannot establish its Application Support storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法建立其 Application Support 存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium cannot prove whether the native Trash move completed. After you inspect Finder and the listed paths, Resolve releases the deletion gate without restoring or removing a file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法确认原生纸篓移动是否完成。检查 Finder 和列出的路径后，“解决”会释放删除门，不会恢复或移除文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium connects only to Zotero Desktop on localhost and never modifies its data. No account or API key is required." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 仅通过 localhost 连接 Zotero Desktop，且绝不修改其数据。无需账户或 API 密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not build a usable Search index. Details: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium could not build a usable Search index. Details: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法构建可用的搜索索引。详情：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not publish a replacement Search index. The last complete results remain available. Details: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium could not publish a replacement Search index. The last complete results remain available. Details: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法发布替代搜索索引。上一次完整结果仍可用。详情：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not verify the current Note and will not write it. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法验证当前笔记，因此不会写入。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not verify the interrupted save candidates. Their exact bytes remain unchanged. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法验证中断保存候选内容。其精确字节保持不变。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium first saves every open editor, then restores only if this Note still has the expected revision. If the source changed, recovery stops and keeps the candidate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会先保存所有打开的编辑器，然后仅在此笔记仍为预期版本时恢复。若源文本已更改，恢复将停止并保留候选内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium first saves every open editor, verifies that the candidate is still the canonical source, and then removes only its completed machine-local recovery record." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会先保存所有打开的编辑器，确认候选内容仍是权威源文本，然后仅移除已完成的本机恢复记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium found the file at a new location but cannot safely determine which previous note it belongs to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium found the file at a new location but cannot safely determine which previous note it belongs to."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 在新位置找到了该文件，但无法安全地确定它属于哪个先前的笔记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium keeps source documents authoritative and records each successful Agent mutation with exact before-and-after evidence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 以源文档为权威，并为每次成功的智能体变更记录精确的前后证据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not retrieve the complete Markdown buffer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not retrieve the complete Markdown buffer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 使当前编辑器保持打开状态，因为它无法检索完整的 Markdown 缓冲区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not safely save this note. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not safely save this note. %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 使当前编辑器保持打开状态，因为它无法安全地保存此笔记。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not safely save this note. %arg" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not safely save this note. %arg"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 使当前编辑器保持打开状态，因为它无法安全地保存此笔记。%arg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the current editor open because the note continued changing while it was being saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the current editor open because the note continued changing while it was being saved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 使当前编辑器保持打开状态，因为笔记在保存时不断变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the document open because the active editor changed from %@ to %@ before it could be saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the document open because the active editor changed from %@ to %@ before it could be saved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 使文档保持打开状态，因为活动编辑器在保存之前从 %@ 更改为 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the document open because the active editor changed from %arg to %arg before it could be saved." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the document open because the active editor changed from %1$arg to %2$arg before it could be saved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 使文档保持打开状态，因为活动编辑器在保存之前从 %1$arg 更改为 %2$arg。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the exact editor buffer open because this document is no longer available through the active Triptych." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the exact editor buffer open because this document is no longer available through the active Triptych."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 保留了原始编辑缓冲区，因为此文档已无法通过当前脉络访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept this window open because the current note could not be saved. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因当前笔记无法保存，Scholium 保留了此窗口。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium reread the portable settings after an uncertain save. Review the current saved version before trying again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 已在保存结果不确定后重新读取便携设置。请先检查当前已保存版本，再重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium stores the small portable .scholium folder beside Works. macOS therefore asks once for access to the folder containing Works; it is not added as a fourth vault." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium stores the small portable .scholium folder beside Works. macOS therefore asks once for access to the folder containing Works; it is not added as a fourth vault."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 将小型便携式 .scholium 文件夹存放在“写作”研究库旁。因此，macOS 会请求访问包含“写作”的文件夹；该文件夹不会成为第四个研究库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will move the entire existing .scholium folder to a uniquely named sibling recovery folder, preserving its exact files without interpreting the old schema. Analyses, Topics, and Works will not be changed. Scholium will then create current portable control state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会将现有的整个 .scholium 文件夹移至一个名称唯一的同级恢复文件夹，原样保留其中的文件，且不会解释旧 schema。Analyses、Topics 和 Works 不会被更改。随后 Scholium 会创建当前版本的便携控制数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will not recreate a missing Note from temporary recovery. Inspect or copy the retained candidate instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 不会依据临时恢复数据重新创建缺失的笔记。请改为检查或复制保留的候选内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will preserve the unreadable Saved Search file under a unique recovery name, then start with an empty Saved Searches list. No vault files will be changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会用唯一的恢复名称保留无法读取的已存搜索文件，然后以空的已存搜索列表重新开始。不会更改任何研究库文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will preserve this record’s exact bytes under a unique recovery name, remove only that invalid record from the active Metadata catalog, and reload the Triptych. Markdown and every other portable control file remain unchanged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会将此记录的精确字节保存在唯一的恢复名称下，仅从活动元数据目录中移除该无效记录，然后重新载入三库工作区。Markdown 和其他所有可移植控制文件均保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will recheck the exact Markdown source and portable identity. It may add the reserved identity to the exact created source, or remove that same reserved identity when the source is absent. Any other identity at the path, any Zotero binding on an identity that would be removed, or changed or unreadable state stops for separate researcher resolution. Markdown source is never created, replaced, or removed, and no other portable identity is changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会重新检查精确的 Markdown 源文本与可携带身份。它只会为精确的新建源文本添加预留身份，或在源文本不存在时移除同一个预留身份。若路径上存在任何其他身份、待移除身份已绑定 Zotero，或状态已变化或不可读，恢复都会停止并等待研究者另行处理。Markdown 源文本绝不会被创建、替换或移除，任何其他可携带身份也不会被更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will remove only this Triptych’s registration from this Mac, then open setup again. It will not delete or change Analyses, Topics, Works, or the portable .scholium folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium will remove only this Triptych’s registration from this Mac, then open setup again. It will not delete or change Analyses, Topics, Works, or the portable .scholium folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 将只移除此 Mac 上的这个脉络注册，然后重新打开设置。它不会删除或更改“分析”“议题”“写作”或便携式 .scholium 文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will resume only the persisted forward plan. Items already moved to the macOS Trash remain under Finder control; Scholium only completes portable identity and Critique cleanup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 只会继续执行已持久化的前向计划。已移入 macOS 纸篓的项目仍由 Finder 管理；Scholium 只完成可移植身份和评析清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
