            "value" : "此草稿载入后，已保存的元数据设置发生了更改。已保存版本和此草稿均已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved window layout could not be restored. Scholium opened a clean window instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The saved window layout could not be restored. Scholium opened a clean window instead."
          }
