            "value" : "无法恢复保存的窗口布局。Scholium 打开了一个干净的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected appearance has unsaved changes. Switching configurations will discard them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选外观有未保存的更改。切换配置将丢弃这些更改。"
          }
